{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Nimbe1wABMpypAnXgC37jf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ah! I see the issue now. There's already a `campaigns` table in the Supabase project. And there's also `meta_accounts` and `users` and `reports` and other tables already created. The Supabase project is being shared with other services.\n\nSo the schema is already mostly there! That means INFRA-001 (Supabase Database Schema Setup) might already be done or partially done. Let me check if the required tables exist and if they match the spec:\n\nLooking at the list, I can see:\n- users (exists)\n- meta_accounts (exists)\n- campaigns (exists)\n- reports (exists)\n\nBut I don't see:\n- ad_sets\n- ads\n- ad_performance_metrics\n- recommendations\n- alerts\n\nSo I need to create only the missing tables. Also, the campaigns table structure might not match what we need. Let me check if there are ad_sets and ads tables by looking more carefully. I don't see them, so I need to create them.\n\nLet me create the missing tables:","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4141,"cache_read_input_tokens":114885,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4141},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55793a17-4f50-4b66-a54a-24d9bccc2747","uuid":"25788135-4a36-4ba8-bad9-d67a9d1326c5"}
